<!-- ════════════════ 33 · PRICING LEVERS ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Pricing levers" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #1e40af;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="4" y1="21" x2="4" y2="14"/><line x1="4" y1="10" x2="4" y2="3"/><line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="3"/><line x1="20" y1="21" x2="20" y2="16"/><line x1="20" y1="12" x2="20" y2="3"/><line x1="1" y1="14" x2="7" y2="14"/><line x1="9" y1="8" x2="15" y2="8"/><line x1="17" y1="16" x2="23" y2="16"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">33</span>API &amp; cost</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Know the levers behind the <span class="accent">price</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 36px; align-content: start;">
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Caching</span>
          <h3>Write vs read</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Cache read ~0.1x: up to 90% off.</li>
            <li>But cache write costs 1.25x. Only pays off from ~2 reuses.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Speed</span>
          <h3>Slower = cheaper</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Batch and OpenAI Flex: ~50% off for non-urgent work.</li>
            <li>&ldquo;Priority&rdquo; is ~2x to 2.5x more expensive.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <span class="lab">Hidden</span>
          <h3>Silent costs</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Gemini cache storage ~$4.50/M tokens/hour on 2.5 Pro, ~$1.00 on Flash models.</li>
            <li>Long context can carry a surcharge (Gemini &gt;200K); Claude does not.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        Caching only pays off with repetition. <strong>Calculate the break-even</strong> and don't cache one-off prompts.
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #94a3b8; margin: 14px 4px 0;"><strong>Sources:</strong> Anthropic (platform.claude.com/docs &middot; prompt caching, service tiers) &middot; OpenAI (Flex &amp; prompt caching) &middot; Google Gemini API pricing. Figures as of 2026-06-17; multipliers are stable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "33" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "55" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
